  "details": "Currently we cannot grab our own seats. This proves a problem for people who want to make avatars with certain features or gimmicks. Many people have developed Roller Coasters, Portal Systems and things like that, but are unable to use them because or this restriction. I think adding this option as an sdk Station setting would allow people to make what they want, in a  way that wouldn't cause problems with existing seats. It would likely remain a niche feature used by enthusiasts. \nI'm currently working on a working and flyable spaceship for avatars and this is the last thing i need complete it.",
